 * @param str The string to convert to a {@link Number}. May be {@code null}.
 * @return A {@link Number} object representing the value of the string,
 *         or {@code null} if the input string is {@code null}.
 * @throws NumberFormatException If the string is blank, starts with "--",
 *                               or cannot be parsed into a valid number according
 *                               to any supported format, or if a type suffix
 *                               is used but the number cannot be accurately
 *                               represented by that specific type.
